# Purple, the New Black: LOCKED, and a menu outliving its fight (as puppet_in_peril#busy): bob, cid and eve are each
# offered the menu while main is in; bob does not answer it; cid's late update is answered with [4] and cid finishes;
# the win's finish sets main's WotG 7 status 2; after the win and cleanup eve's update is answered with [5].
lists LaVauleS/_2d1/onTrigger LaVauleS/onEventFinish/2 LaVauleS/onEventUpdate/32000 LaVauleS/onEventFinish/32000 LaVauleS/onEventFinish/32001 LaVauleS/onEventFinish/32002 LaVauleS/_2d3/onTrigger
